这是怎么回事？

03:27.508 --> 03:29.377
ACCORDING TO MY ALGORITHM,
根据我的算法，

03:29.377 --> 03:32.846
BEACH-GOERS SHOULD BE FAMISHED
AND LOOKING FOR A TREAT.
海滩游客应该挨饿
并寻找美食。

03:32.846 --> 03:35.716
A TREAT LIKE CHUM!
HELLO!
像密友一样的款待！
你好！

03:35.716 --> 03:38.185
IT'S PERFECTLY EDIBLE, PEOPLE.
人们，它完全可以食用。

03:39.720 --> 03:41.522
OH, COME ON, MAN!
哦，来吧，伙计！

03:41.522 --> 03:43.357
THIS IS MY LIVELIHOOD!
这是我的生计！

03:43.357 --> 03:44.758
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

03:44.758 --> 03:46.694
A BEAUTIFUL DAY
BEACHSIDE.
美好的一天
海滨。

03:46.694 --> 03:49.430
I COULDN'T THINK OF A THING
THAT COULD RUIN THIS.
我什么也想不起来
那可能会毁了这一切。

03:49.430 --> 03:51.031
- I COULD THINK OF A FEW.
- 我能想到一些。

03:56.704 --> 03:59.172
HEY.
YOU'RE BLOCKING MY LIGHT.
嘿。
你挡住了我的光。

03:59.172 --> 04:00.474
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

04:00.474 --> 04:03.210
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:03.210 --> 04:05.679
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

04:05.679 --> 04:07.147
[screaming]
[尖叫]

04:07.147 --> 04:08.349
[Patrick chuckles]
[帕特里克笑]

04:09.517 --> 04:11.885
- AH, SWEET KARMA.
- 啊，甜蜜的因果报应。

04:11.885 --> 04:14.922
IT CAN COME FROM
THE MOST BONEHEADED OF PLACES.
它可以来自
最愚蠢的地方。

04:14.922 --> 04:18.392
[Patrick and SpongeBob
giggling]
[帕特里克和海绵宝宝
咯咯笑]

04:18.392 --> 04:20.227
