等一下。

04:20.227 --> 04:22.663
WHAT ARE THOSE BOUNCING BLOBS
OF GOO?
那些弹跳的斑点是什么
粘的？

04:22.663 --> 04:25.466
- [grunts]
I DON'T KNOW, AND I DON'T CARE.
- [咕哝]
我不知道，也不关心。

04:25.466 --> 04:29.102
[both cackling]
[两人咯咯地笑]

04:29.102 --> 04:31.605
HOLD IT!
坚持住！

04:31.605 --> 04:34.375
WHAT I WANNA KNOW
IS WHY YOU TWO HAVE RUINED
我想知道什么
这就是你们两个毁掉的原因

04:34.375 --> 04:36.710
MY ATTEMPTS
AT HAVING AN EVEN TAN.
我的尝试
晒黑均匀。

04:36.710 --> 04:38.178
- OH, SORRY, SQUIDWARD.
- 哦，对不起，章鱼哥。

04:38.178 --> 04:40.348
WE'RE RIDING
ON THESE COOL GOO BUBBLES.
我们正在骑行
在这些凉爽的粘稠气泡上。

04:40.348 --> 04:41.982
THEY'RE FLOATING
OUT OF GOO LAGOON.
他们漂浮着
离开古泻湖。

04:41.982 --> 04:43.784
[metal clanking]
[金属叮当作响]

04:43.784 --> 04:47.755
[electronic pulses]
[电子脉冲]

04:47.755 --> 04:50.358
all: AAAAAAH!
全体：啊啊啊！

04:55.629 --> 04:58.966
- STOP!
THOSE BUBBLES ARE DANGEROUS!
- 停止！
那些气泡很危险！

04:58.966 --> 05:00.668
- DANGEROUS?
- 危险的？

05:00.668 --> 05:02.536
- FASCINATING.
TELL US MORE.
- 迷人。
告诉我们更多信息。

05:02.536 --> 05:04.972
- YEAH, BUT WITH VISUAL AIDS.
- 是的，但是有视觉辅助工具。

05:04.972 --> 05:09.142
- OKAY.
- 好的。

05:09.142 --> 05:11.111
MY SCIENTIFIC INVESTIGATION
HAS REVEALED
我的科学研究
已经揭晓

05:11.111 --> 05:13.246
THAT DEEP BENEATH
THE LAGOON FLOOR
在那深处
泻湖层

05:13.246 --> 05:16.016
IS A VOLCANIC POCKET
OF SUPER GOO.
是一个火山袋
超级粘稠。

05:16.016 --> 05:17.250
A CRACK HAS FORMED,
裂缝已经形成，

05:17.250 --> 05:19.387
RELEASING BUBBLES OF THE GOOP
TO THE SURFACE,
释放粘液中的气泡
到表面，

05:19.387 --> 05:22.423
WHICH ARE TOXIC
AND VERY UNSTABLE.
哪些有毒
并且非常不稳定。

05:22.423 --> 05:25.493
AT ANY MOMENT,
IT COULD LOSE ITS INTEGRITY,
在任何时刻，
它可能会失去完整性，

05:25.493 --> 05:28.629
AND BOOM!
IT'LL EXPLODE.
繁荣！
它会爆炸。

05:28.629 --> 05:30.698
- THAT RODENT'S RIGHT.
- 那只啮齿动物是对的。

05:30.698 --> 05:34.568
A GIANT GOO BUBBLE COULD REALLY
LEVEL THE PLAYING FIELD.
一个巨大的粘性泡沫真的可以
创造公平的竞争环境。

05:34.568 --> 05:37.605
IF SOMEONE WERE ABLE
TO CONTROL ITS POWER,
如果有人能够
为了控制它的力量，

05:37.605 --> 05:40.307
THEY'D CONTROL ALL
OF BIKINI BOTTOM.
他们会控制一切
的比基尼底部。

05:40.307 --> 05:43.777
AND I'M GONNA BE
THAT SOMEONE.
我将会成为
那个人。

05:43.777 --> 05:45.413
[beep]
[嘟]

05:49.282 --> 05:51.819
[power surge]
[电源浪涌]

06:03.497 --> 06:07.034
- IT'S SO GOOEY.
- 太粘了。

06:07.034 --> 06:09.970
- [muffled] I CAN FIT IT
IN MY MOUTH.
- [闷闷不乐]我可以适应它
在我嘴里。

06:09.970 --> 06:12.506
OOH, IT TASTES
LIKE LICORICE.
哦，味道好极了
像甘草一样。

06:12.506 --> 06:15.242
- YOU IDIOTS!
THAT GOO IS DANGEROUS!
-你们这些白痴！
那粘糊糊的东西很危险！

06:15.242 --> 06:17.445
WEREN'T YOU TWO MORONS
LISTENING?
你们不是两个白痴吗
听？

06:17.445 --> 06:20.448
- NO, NOT REALLY.
I DRIFTED OFF.
- 不，不是真的。
我迷迷糊糊地走了。

06:20.448 --> 06:24.084
- BUT JUST LOOK AT ALL
THE COOL STUFF IT CAN DO.
- 但只要看看
它能做的很酷的事情。

06:24.084 --> 06:26.854
YOU CAN MAKE A HAT...
OR A BEARD.
你可以做一顶帽子...
或胡子。

06:26.854 --> 06:29.490
- OR AN AWESOME TOUPEE.
- 或者一顶很棒的假发。

06:29.490 --> 06:34.327
- TOUPEE?
YOU MEAN...HAIR?
- 假发？
你是说……头发？

06:34.327 --> 06:35.596
HOW DO I LOOK?
我看起来怎么样？

06:35.596 --> 06:38.566
- WHAT IS WRONG
WITH YOU PEOPLE?
- 出了什么问题
和你们一起吗？

06:38.566 --> 06:40.801
THAT GOO CAN DESTROY
EVERYTHING!
粘液可以摧毁
一切！

06:40.801 --> 06:42.636
- SEEMS SAFE TO ME.
- 对我来说似乎很安全。

06:42.636 --> 06:45.172
- THAT'S WHAT THEY SAID
ABOUT MICROWAVE OVENS,
- 他们就是这么说的
关于微波炉，

06:45.172 --> 06:47.475
DRY CLEANING,
AND CORNDOGS.
干洗，
还有玉米狗。

06:47.475 --> 06:49.209
- SEE YA LATER, SANDY.
- 再见，桑迪。

06:49.209 --> 06:52.813
- YEAH, THESE GOO BUBBLES
WON'T BOUNCE THEMSELVES.
- 是的，这些粘稠的气泡
不会弹起。

06:55.348 --> 06:58.719
- YOU HAVE BEEN WARNED.
- 你已被警告。

06:58.719 --> 07:02.022
