[冲浪音乐]

07:02.022 --> 07:03.957
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:03.957 --> 07:07.728
- OH, MAN, WHERE WILL WE GET
ANOTHER BALL?
- 哦，伙计，我们要去哪里
另一个球？

07:07.728 --> 07:10.664
- WHY NOT TRY
A GOO BUBBLE?
- 为什么不尝试
粘稠的泡沫？

07:10.664 --> 07:12.500
- THANKS.
- 谢谢。

07:12.500 --> 07:14.902
HEY, IT STICKS LIKE GLUE.
嘿，它像胶水一样粘在一起。

07:14.902 --> 07:18.572
GO LONG.
做多。

07:21.241 --> 07:23.076
- [laughs]
AWESOME!
- [笑]
太棒了！

07:23.076 --> 07:24.978
I STILL GOT IT.
我还是明白了。

07:24.978 --> 07:27.881
I WISH I COULD SWIM.
我希望我会游泳。

07:27.881 --> 07:30.083
- IT'S SO HOT.
- 太热了。

07:33.521 --> 07:35.889
OH, IT'S SO COOLING.
哦，太酷了。

07:35.889 --> 07:37.290
THANKS, GOO.
谢谢，古。

07:37.290 --> 07:38.892
- THANKS, GOO.
- 谢谢，古。

07:38.892 --> 07:40.628
- THANKS, GOO.
- 谢谢，古。

07:40.628 --> 07:42.730
all: THANKS, GOO.
全体：谢谢，咕。

07:42.730 --> 07:46.534
- AND NOW WE GO
TO PERCH PERKINS AT THE SCENE.
- 现在我们走了
在现场栖息珀金斯。

07:46.534 --> 07:48.068
- THAT'S RIGHT,
PERCH PERKINS HERE
- 没错，
鲈鱼帕金斯在这里

07:48.068 --> 07:50.203
AT GOO LAGOON,
BRINGING YOU THE LATEST
在古泻湖，
为您带来最新资讯

07:50.203 --> 07:52.039
ON THE SUPER GOO EVENT.
关于超级粘液事件。

07:52.039 --> 07:55.242
WHAT DO YOU THINK
OF SUPER GOO, YOUNG MAN?
你觉得怎么样
超级粘，年轻人？

07:55.242 --> 07:58.411
- I'M ON TV!
- 我上电视了！

07:58.411 --> 08:02.449
- AND YOU, SIR.
WHAT'S YOUR OPINION?
- 还有你，先生。
您有何看法？

08:02.449 --> 08:04.051
UH, SIR?
呃，先生？

08:04.051 --> 08:05.586
- IT'S AWESOME.
- 太棒了。

08:05.586 --> 08:07.555
- UH, THAT'S GREAT.
- 呃，那太好了。

08:07.555 --> 08:09.890
LET'S GET SOME COMMENTS
FROM SOME OTHER BEACH-GOERS.
让我们听听一些评论
来自其他一些海滩游客的声音。

08:09.890 --> 08:13.594
- I HAVE A COMMENT.
SUPER GOO IS EVIL!
- 我有意见。
超级粘液是邪恶的！

08:13.594 --> 08:15.563
STAY IN YOUR HOMES!
呆在家里！

08:15.563 --> 08:19.199
- YES, SIRREE,
THE GOO BUBBLES CERTAINLY ARE
- 是的，先生，
粘性泡沫确实存在

08:19.199 --> 08:20.734
GETTING FOLKS EXCITED.
让人们兴奋不已。

08:20.734 --> 08:23.236
both: WE SURE ARE EXCITED.
两人：我们确实很兴奋。

08:23.236 --> 08:25.906
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:25.906 --> 08:29.677
- I CAN'T FIND THIS THING
ANYWHERE.
- 我找不到这个东西
任何地方。

08:29.677 --> 08:31.945
COME ON NOW, THINK,
PLANKTON.
现在来吧，想一想，
浮游生物。

08:31.945 --> 08:34.181
IF YOU WERE A GIANT BUBBLE
OF DANGEROUS GOO,
如果你是一个巨大的泡沫
危险的粘液，

08:34.181 --> 08:35.382
WHERE WOULD YOU BE?
你会在哪里？

08:35.382 --> 08:37.450
- SHELDON, THIS SHIP
WASN'T DESIGNED
- 谢尔顿，这艘船
不是设计的

08:37.450 --> 08:38.919
TO REACH THESE DEPTHS.
达到这些深度。

08:38.919 --> 08:40.621
- THAT'S GREAT,
SWEETHEART.
- 太棒了，
甜心。

08:40.621 --> 08:42.723
- IF YOU CONTINUE THIS SEARCH
MUCH LONGER,
- 如果您继续此搜索
更长的时间，

08:42.723 --> 08:45.292
YOUR POWER SUPPLY WILL DEPLETE
AND YOU'LL SINK.
您的电源将会耗尽
你就会沉没。

08:45.292 --> 08:48.061
- ALL RIGHT, KAREN,
I'LL MAKE SURE I WRITE THAT DOWN
- 好吧，凯伦，
我会确保把它写下来

08:48.061 --> 08:49.597
IN MY BOOK TITLED
在我的书里

08:49.597 --> 08:51.765
INSIGNIFICANT THINGS
MY WIFE TOLD ME.
无关紧要的事情
我妻子告诉我的。

08:51.765 --> 08:53.701
- WHATEVER.
GO GET STUCK AT THE BOTTOM
- 任何。
陷入谷底

08:53.701 --> 08:54.902
OF GOO LAGOON.
古泻湖。

08:54.902 --> 08:57.004
IT'S YOUR FUNERAL.
- WHAT DID YOU SAY?
这是你的葬礼。
- 你说什么？

08:57.004 --> 09:00.440
- I SAID, GO GET STUCK
AT THE BOTTOM OF GOO LAGOON.
- 我说，去吧，被困住
在粘泻湖底部。

09:00.440 --> 09:01.675
- THAT'S IT, KAREN!
- 就是这样，凯伦！

09:01.675 --> 09:03.777
THE GOO BUBBLE MUST BE STUCK
AT THE BOTTOM.
粘稠的泡沫必须被困住
在底部。

09:03.777 --> 09:05.445
WE JUST HAVE TO
GET DOWN THERE.
我们只需要
到那里去。

09:05.445 --> 09:08.916
KAREN, CUT THE POWER
TO THE ENTIRE SHIP.
凯伦，切断电源
到整艘船。

09:08.916 --> 09:10.183
YES.
是的。

09:10.183 --> 09:13.621
[sinister laughter]
[阴险的笑声]

09:13.621 --> 09:15.522
LOOK, THERE IT IS.
看，就在那里。

09:15.522 --> 09:19.627
KAREN, FIRE UP
THE ENGINE POWER.
凯伦，火起来
发动机功率。

09:19.627 --> 09:21.795
WITH MY MECHANICAL
CLAM DIGGER,
用我的机械
挖蛤者，

09:21.795 --> 09:25.633
I'LL CRACK OPEN THIS GOO-CANO
EASY AS A CLAM.
我要打开这个古卡诺
简单易行。

09:25.633 --> 09:27.234
WHICH IS WHAT
IT WAS BUILT FOR,
哪个是什么
它是为，

09:27.234 --> 09:30.738
SO, YOU KNOW,
THAT MAKES SENSE.
所以，你知道，
这是有道理的。

09:30.738 --> 09:34.474
[sinister laughter]
[阴险的笑声]

09:34.474 --> 09:36.810
YES. YES!
是的。是的！

09:36.810 --> 09:39.680
BUBBLE FORTH,
MY GOOEY WRATH!
冒出气泡，
我的愤怒！

09:39.680 --> 09:41.481
[earth rumbling]
[大地轰鸣]

09:41.481 --> 09:44.517
AND NOW TO GET THE DING DANG
OUT OF HERE.
现在就来获取叮当
离开这里。

09:44.517 --> 09:48.656
[earth rumbling]
[大地轰鸣]

09:48.656 --> 09:51.158
- LOOK!
- 看！

09:51.158 --> 09:53.661
GIANT GOO BUBBLE!
巨大的粘液泡泡！

09:53.661 --> 09:56.764
- SEE, I TOLD YA!
[panting]
- 看，我告诉过你了！
[气喘吁吁]

09:56.764 --> 09:59.833
RUN FOR YOUR LIFE!
为你的生命而奔跑！

09:59.833 --> 10:02.035
- SANDY'S REALLY
GETTING OUT OF HAND.
- 桑迪真的
失控。

10:04.905 --> 10:05.939
- THIS IS PERCH PERKINS
REPORTING LIVE
- 这是鲈鱼帕金斯
现场报道

10:05.939 --> 10:07.841
FROM GOO LAGOON,
WHERE I'M STANDING
从古泻湖出发，
我站的地方

10:07.841 --> 10:10.711
IN FRONT OF WHAT APPEARS TO BE
SOME SORT OF GIGANTIC,
在看似的事物面前
某种巨大的，

10:10.711 --> 10:13.180
GOOEY BUBBLE
RISING OUT OF THE WATER
粘糊糊的泡泡
从水中升起

10:13.180 --> 10:14.848
INTO THE WATER.
进入水中。

10:14.848 --> 10:16.650
WITH ME IS SANDY CHEEKS.
和我在一起的是沙质脸颊。

10:16.650 --> 10:19.386
MISS CHEEKS, AS BIKINI BOTTOM'S
RESIDENT KNOW-IT-ALL,
脸颊小姐，比基尼下装
居民无所不知，

10:19.386 --> 10:21.054
WE LOOK TO YOU
FOR ANSWERS.
我们期待您
寻求答案。

10:21.054 --> 10:22.856
WHO? WHAT? HOW?
WHY? WHEN?
WHO？什么？如何？
为什么？什么时候？

10:22.856 --> 10:25.292
- WELL, PERCH,
I WON'T REALLY KNOW ANYTHING
- 好吧，鲈鱼，
我真的什么都不知道

10:25.292 --> 10:27.828
UNTIL I RUN SOME TESTS,
BUT I CAN TELL YOU
直到我进行一些测试，
但我可以告诉你

10:27.828 --> 10:29.663
IT'S PRETTY SERIOUS.
这是相当严重的。

10:29.663 --> 10:31.899
NOW, IF YOU'LL EXCUSE ME,
I NEED TO GET GOING.
现在，请原谅我，
我得走了。

10:31.899 --> 10:36.536
- OH, YES. OF COURSE.
- 哦是的。当然。

10:36.536 --> 10:39.572
THIS IS PERCH PERKINS,
AND I'M SOAKING WET.
这是鲈鱼帕金斯，
我浑身湿透了。

10:39.572 --> 10:40.874
BACK TO YOU.
回到你身边。

10:40.874 --> 10:43.276
- WOW, IT'S SO BIG.
- 哇，它太大了。

10:43.276 --> 10:46.013
- THAT THERE'S
A TEXAS-SIZE BUBBLE!
- 那有
德克萨斯州大小的泡沫！

10:46.013 --> 10:48.716
FIRST, WE'LL CHECK
ITS TENSILE STRENGTH.
首先，我们要检查
它的拉伸强度。

10:48.716 --> 10:51.685
[thuds echo]
TIGHT AS A DRUM.
[重击声回声]
紧如鼓。

10:51.685 --> 10:54.454
- OH, I WANNA PLAY
THE DRUM!
- 哦，我想玩
鼓！

10:54.454 --> 10:57.357
- NO, PATRICK, DON'T!
THAT THING'S VOLATILE.
- 不，帕特里克，不要！
那东西是不稳定的。

10:57.357 --> 11:00.160
THERE'S NO TELLING WHAT KIND OF
DAMAGE IT'LL CAUSE IF IT POPS.
不知道是什么样的
如果弹出会造成损坏。

11:00.160 --> 11:02.629
- OH, FINE. HERE!
- 哦，好吧。这里！

11:02.629 --> 11:05.332
I DON'T NEED
THAT OLD STICK ANYWAYS.
我不需要
无论如何，那根旧棍子。

11:05.332 --> 11:06.433
[grunts]
[咕哝]

11:10.403 --> 11:12.840
- COME ON, GUYS, WE STILL HAVE
MORE TESTS TO PERFORM.
- 来吧，伙计们，我们还有
需要执行更多测试。

11:12.840 --> 11:14.574
I NEED A SAMPLE.
BE A DARLING
我需要一个样品。
做一个亲爱的

11:14.574 --> 11:17.344
AND HAND ME THAT THERE BUCKET.
然后把那个桶递给我。

11:17.344 --> 11:18.611
[doink doink]
[嘟嘟嘟]

11:18.611 --> 11:20.781
[pop]
[流行音乐]

11:20.781 --> 11:23.150
[goo squishing]
[咕咕挤压]

11:23.150 --> 11:24.351
OKAY, SPONGEBOB,
好吧，海绵宝宝，

11:24.351 --> 11:28.521
PUT A LITTLE OF THAT GLOOP
IN THIS ANALYZER.
放一点那个胶水
在此分析仪中。

11:28.521 --> 11:34.895
[beeps, blips]
[嘟嘟声，光点]

11:34.895 --> 11:36.296
[power sputtering]
[功率溅射]

11:36.296 --> 11:37.831
THIS IS WORSE
THAN I THOUGHT.
这更糟
比我想象的要多。

11:37.831 --> 11:40.233
- LOOK, SANDY.
[laughter]
- 看，桑迪。
[笑声]

11:40.233 --> 11:41.601
- HOW MANY TIMES
DO I HAVE TO TELL YOU
- 多少次
我必须告诉你吗

11:41.601 --> 11:42.836
THAT STUFF'S DANGEROUS?
那东西危险吗？

11:42.836 --> 11:44.537
NOW, HOW ARE Y'ALL GONNA
CLEAN THAT GUNK OFF?
现在，你们打算怎样
把那团东西清理掉吗？

11:44.537 --> 11:46.774
- OH, YEAH. GROSS.
- 哦，是的。总的。

11:46.774 --> 11:49.376
GOOD THING I KEEP
A SPARE SET OF HANDS.
我保留的好东西
备用双手。

11:52.412 --> 11:55.515
- OH, YEAH.
- 哦，是的。

11:55.515 --> 11:59.152
- UH, I HAVE A BETTER IDEA.
- 呃，我有一个更好的主意。

11:59.152 --> 12:01.889
HOLD OUT YOUR HANDS.
伸出你的手。

12:03.791 --> 12:06.293
- OOH, THEY SHINE.
- 哦，他们闪闪发光。

12:06.293 --> 12:08.395
- WELL, IT SEEMS
TO HAVE STABILIZED.
- 嗯，看起来
已经稳定下来。

12:08.395 --> 12:10.530
- AS LONG AS IT DOESN'T GET
ANY BIGGER,
- 只要它没有得到
任何更大的，

12:10.530 --> 12:12.299
THERE'S NOT TOO MUCH
TO WORRY ABOUT.
没有太多
担心。

12:12.299 --> 12:13.834
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

12:13.834 --> 12:15.602
THAT AIN'T GOOD.
那不好。

12:15.602 --> 12:19.106
all: AAAAAHH...
全体：啊啊啊……

12:23.243 --> 12:25.678
- SO, MISS CHEEKS,
WHAT'S THE PROGNOSIS?
- 那么，奇克斯小姐，
预后如何？

12:25.678 --> 12:27.815
- WELL, PERCH,
IT'S MY CONSIDERED OPINION
- 好吧，鲈鱼，
这是我深思熟虑的意见

12:27.815 --> 12:29.316
THAT NOW WOULD BE
A GOOD TIME TO...
现在会是
好时机...

12:29.316 --> 12:32.452
[rumbling]
RUN LIKE HECK!
[隆隆声]
尽情奔跑吧！

12:32.452 --> 12:33.620
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

12:33.620 --> 12:35.388
- WELL, THERE YOU HAVE IT.
- 好吧，你已经拿到了。

12:35.388 --> 12:37.524
THIS IS PERCH PERKINS,
ABOUT TO BE SWALLOWED
这是鲈鱼帕金斯，
即将被吞噬

12:37.524 --> 12:38.926
BY A GIANT WAVE.
通过巨浪。

12:38.926 --> 12:40.727
[emergency tone]
[紧急提示音]

12:40.727 --> 12:44.965
[earth rumbling,
all shouting]
【大地轰鸣，
都在喊]

12:46.333 --> 12:49.369
- I'LL CATCH UP.
I GOTTA USE THE CAN.
- 我会赶上的。
我得用罐子。

12:51.905 --> 12:54.041
- WHOA.
- 哇哦。

12:56.944 --> 12:58.979
- UNH!
- 呃！

13:02.950 --> 13:05.886
WHEW! THAT WAS A CLOSE ONE.
哇！那是一场势均力敌的比赛。

13:05.886 --> 13:08.255
- HELP! HELP!
- 帮助！帮助！

13:08.255 --> 13:10.590
HEEELP!
哎呀！

13:10.590 --> 13:13.593
I'M OUT OF TOILET PAPER
IN HERE.
我的卫生纸用完了
在这里。

13:15.328 --> 13:16.696
- LOOK OUT!
- 当心！

13:18.866 --> 13:21.068
- AAH!
- 啊啊！

13:21.068 --> 13:24.872
- HANG ON, BUDDY.
JUST A LITTLE BIT MORE.
- 坚持住，伙计。
再多一点点。

13:24.872 --> 13:26.874
AH! GOTCHA!
啊！明白了！

13:28.241 --> 13:30.377
OH, I DON'T GOTCHA.
AAH!
哦，我不明白。
啊啊！

13:34.948 --> 13:37.784
- HELP!
[whimpering]
- 帮助！
[呜咽]

13:37.784 --> 13:39.186
- NOW WHAT DO WE DO?
- 现在我们该怎么办？

13:39.186 --> 13:41.889
- WE NEED TO GET
TO MY SUBMARINE, FAST.
- 我们需要得到
到我的潜艇，快。

13:43.356 --> 13:44.691
SQUIDWARD,
IT'S AN EMERGENCY!
章鱼哥，
情况紧急！

13:44.691 --> 13:46.659
I'M GONNA NEED YOUR BIKE.
我需要你的自行车。

13:46.659 --> 13:49.129
HOP ON, SPONGEBOB.
跳上来，海绵宝宝。

13:53.000 --> 13:55.735
- SHEESH, YOU'D THINK
THE SKY WAS FALLING.
- 嘘，你会想
天塌下来了。

13:57.137 --> 14:00.607
I AM GOING TO LEARN
TO KEEP MY BIG MOUTH SHUT.
我要学习
让我闭嘴。

14:00.607 --> 14:03.710
- AAH! AAH!
- 啊啊！啊啊！

14:03.710 --> 14:07.014
[laughing]
[笑]

14:10.283 --> 14:14.087
HOWDY, SPONGE...BLOB.
你好，海绵……一团。

14:14.087 --> 14:17.657
I'M SO GLAD YOU COULD
STICK AROUND.
我很高兴你能
坚持下去。

14:17.657 --> 14:20.293
[laughs]
GLAD.
[笑]
很高兴。

14:20.293 --> 14:23.263
- HOLD ON, PATRICK.
WE'RE HERE TO RESCUE YOU.
- 坚持住，帕特里克。
我们是来拯救你的。

14:23.263 --> 14:25.698
- AW, GO RESCUE
SOMEBODY ELSE.
- 哇，去救援
其他人。

14:25.698 --> 14:29.536
CAN'T YOU SEE I'M PLAYING
WITH MY FRIEND SPONGEBLOB?
你没看到我在玩吗
和我的朋友海绵宝宝一起？

14:33.273 --> 14:35.642
DON'T WORRY,
I'LL NEVER LEAVE YOU.
别担心，
我永远不会离开你。

14:35.642 --> 14:37.177
HUH?
嗯？

14:37.177 --> 14:38.946
NOOOOOO...
不……

14:38.946 --> 14:40.981
GOOD-BYE, SPONGEBLOB.
再见，海绵宝宝。

14:43.583 --> 14:45.818
HI, SPONGEBOB.
HI, SANDY.
嗨，海绵宝宝。
嗨，桑迪。

14:47.587 --> 14:49.022
- SO WHAT DO WE DO NOW,
SANDY?
- 那么我们现在做什么，
桑迪？

14:49.022 --> 14:51.558
THAT THING IS HEADED STRAIGHT
FOR DOWNTOWN BIKINI BOTTOM.
那件事正朝着直线发展
适用于市中心比基尼泳裤。

14:51.558 --> 14:53.193
- IF THAT THING POPS,
- 如果那东西突然弹出，

14:53.193 --> 14:55.562
WE CAN KISS
OUR BEAUTIFUL TOWN GOOD-BYE.
我们可以接吻
我们美丽的小镇再见。

14:55.562 --> 14:59.232
- GOOD-BYE.
- 再见。

14:59.232 --> 15:03.036
[all crying out]
[全都哭了]

15:06.073 --> 15:10.243
[wedding organ music,
people cheering]
[婚礼管风琴音乐，
人们欢呼]

15:10.243 --> 15:12.245
- HELP ME, MY BELOVED.
- 帮助我，我的爱人。

15:12.245 --> 15:15.983
- DON'T TOUCH ME,
YOU DISGUSTING FREAK!
- 别碰我，
你这个恶心的怪物！

15:15.983 --> 15:20.287
OH...MY DRESS IS RUINED!
哦...我的衣服毁了！

15:22.555 --> 15:24.391
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

15:24.391 --> 15:28.895
- [laughing]
MOMMY GOOPY.
- [笑]
古比妈妈。

15:28.895 --> 15:30.563
- AAAAH!
- 啊啊啊！

15:30.563 --> 15:32.065
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

15:34.301 --> 15:37.004
WHEW.
哇。

15:39.706 --> 15:43.043
- OH, NO! IT'S HEADED
RIGHT FOR NEPTUNE'S TRIDENT.
- 哦，不！它的头
适合海王星的三叉戟。

15:43.043 --> 15:45.445
- I WAS AFRAID
IT MIGHT COME TO THIS.
- 我很害怕
事情可能会发展到这个地步。

15:45.445 --> 15:47.247
IN ORDER TO SAVE THE CITY,
为了拯救城市，

15:47.247 --> 15:50.550
WE MUST DESTROY
PUBLIC PROPERTY.
我们必须摧毁
公共财产。

15:50.550 --> 15:52.885
- SANDY, WHY DO YOU HAVE
MISSILES IN YOUR SUB?
- 桑迪，你为什么有
你的潜艇里有导弹吗？

15:52.885 --> 15:55.355
- YOU KNOW, IN CASE
I GET STUCK IN TRAFFIC.
- 你知道，以防万一
我遇到交通堵塞了。

15:55.355 --> 15:56.689
HERE GOES!
来了！

16:01.194 --> 16:02.862
DARN IT!
该死！

16:04.297 --> 16:07.034
all: AAH!
全体：啊啊！

16:07.034 --> 16:09.136
- HUH? WHAT THE--
- 嗯？什么——

16:09.136 --> 16:10.403
- THAT'S WEIRD.
- 这很奇怪。

16:10.403 --> 16:12.339
IT'S LIKE THAT BUBBLE
HAS A MIND OF ITS OWN.
就像那个泡沫
有自己的想法。

16:12.339 --> 16:15.075
- OR THE MIND
OF SOMEONE ELSE. LOOK!
- 或心灵
别人的。看！

16:17.777 --> 16:20.047
- WHEW.
- PLANKTON!
- 哇。
- 浮游生物！

16:20.047 --> 16:22.215
I KNEW IT.
- YEAH, IT'S ME.
我就知道。
- 是的，是我。

16:22.215 --> 16:23.783
WHAT ARE Y'ALL UP TO
THIS TIME?
你们在忙什么
这次？

16:23.783 --> 16:26.519
- WELL, THAT'S FOR ME TO KNOW
AND FOR YOU TO CLAM UP!
- 嗯，这是我要知道的
让你闭嘴！

16:26.519 --> 16:28.321
- [gasps]
RUDE!
- [喘气]
粗鲁！

16:28.321 --> 16:30.790
- LET'S JUST SAY
I'VE GOT BIG PLANS
- 我们就这么说吧
我有宏伟的计划

16:30.790 --> 16:32.359
FOR THIS LITTLE BUBBLE.
为了这个小泡泡。

16:32.359 --> 16:37.164
[sinister laughter]
[阴险的笑声]

16:37.164 --> 16:42.435
- NOW, IF YOU'LL EXCUSE ME,
I HAVE TO GOO.
- 现在，请原谅我，
我得走了。

16:53.680 --> 16:54.981
[sinister laughter]
[阴险的笑声]

16:54.981 --> 16:57.717
- DANG IT, WE'LL NEVER
CATCH HIM AT THIS RATE.
- 该死的，我们永远不会
以这种速度抓住他。

16:57.717 --> 17:00.253
- HA! THEY'LL NEVER CATCH ME
AT THIS RATE.
- 哈！他们永远抓不到我
按照这个速度。

17:00.253 --> 17:02.089
OH!
哦！

17:02.089 --> 17:05.258
- OH, NO, YOU DON'T!
- 哦，不，你不！

17:05.258 --> 17:07.160
COME HERE,
YA LITTLE VARMINT!
来这里，
你这个小恶鼠！

17:07.160 --> 17:10.097
YOU...STAY...RIGHT...THERE!
你...呆...就在那里！

17:10.097 --> 17:14.301
YIPPEE!
WE GOT HIM NOW.
耶皮！
我们现在找到他了。

17:14.301 --> 17:17.170
- THAT'S RIGHT.
COME TO PAPA.
- 这是正确的。
来爸爸吧。

17:17.170 --> 17:18.738
- WHEN WE GET YOU
OUT OF THERE,
- 当我们找到你时
离开那里，

17:18.738 --> 17:20.673
YOU'VE GOT SOME EXPLAINING
TO DO.
你已经得到了一些解释
要做的事。

17:20.673 --> 17:22.742
- HEY AGAIN, SPONGEBLOB.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

17:22.742 --> 17:24.277
- WE'VE GOT YOU SURROUNDED,
PLANKTON.
- 我们已经把你包围了，
浮游生物。

17:24.277 --> 17:26.579
NOW COME OUT
WITH YOUR ANTENNAE IN THE AIR.
现在出来
将天线悬在空中。

17:26.579 --> 17:29.416
- OH, DEAR,
I GUESS YOU'VE GOT ME.
- 哦，亲爱的，
我想你已经找到我了。

17:29.416 --> 17:31.684
OH, WAIT A SECOND.
NO, YA DON'T!
哦，等一下。
不，你不！

17:33.753 --> 17:36.022
- RETREAT! RETREAT!
- 撤退！撤退！

17:36.022 --> 17:38.425
- AW, DON'T GO SO SOON.
- 噢，别这么快走。

17:38.425 --> 17:41.128
I HOPE YOU BROUGHT
YOUR DANCING SHOES...
我希望你带来
你的舞鞋...

17:43.163 --> 17:47.600
'CAUSE IT'S TIME TO DO
THE ELECTRIC GOO BOOGALOO.
因为是时候行动了
电动粘稠布加洛。

17:47.600 --> 17:50.837
[electricity crackling,
all shouting]
[电噼啪作响，
都在喊]

17:50.837 --> 17:52.672
[sinister laughter]
[阴险的笑声]

17:56.543 --> 17:59.379
all: AAAAHH...
全体：啊啊啊……

17:59.379 --> 18:01.848
WHAAAA...
[thudding]
哇啊啊……
[重击]

18:04.184 --> 18:06.686
- GOOD THING WE LANDED
ON SPONGEBOB.
- 幸好我们着陆了
在海绵宝宝上。

18:06.686 --> 18:08.054
- YEAH, GOOD THING.
- 是的，好东西。

18:08.054 --> 18:11.158
- PLANKTON, YOU CREEPY BACTERIA,
GIMME BACK MY SUB!
- 浮游生物，你这种令人毛骨悚然的细菌，
把我的潜艇还给我！

18:11.158 --> 18:13.626
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

18:13.626 --> 18:16.663
[gasps]
MY SUB!
[喘气]
我的替补！

18:16.663 --> 18:18.064
- THERE, THERE, SANDY.
- 那里，那里，桑迪。

18:18.064 --> 18:21.368
- PLANKTON, YOU'RE--
YOU'RE A BIG MEANIE WEENIE!
- 浮游生物，你是——
你真是个大坏蛋！

18:21.368 --> 18:23.203
YOU WOULDN'T BE
SUCH A TOUGH GUY
你不会的
真是个硬汉

18:23.203 --> 18:24.704
WITHOUT THAT BIG OL' BUBBLE!
没有那个大泡沫！

18:24.704 --> 18:27.174
- TOUGH GUY? BUBBLE?
- 硬汉？气泡？

18:27.174 --> 18:30.810
PATRICK, EUREKA!
INSPIRATION.
帕特里克，尤里卡！
灵感。

18:30.810 --> 18:32.345
- REALLY?
[sniffs]
- 真的吗？
[嗅嗅]

18:32.345 --> 18:34.214
DO I NEED DEODORANT?
我需要除臭剂吗？

18:34.214 --> 18:35.482
- NO, BUT YOU'RE CLOSE.
- 不，但你已经很接近了。

18:35.482 --> 18:37.817
WHAT WE NEED IS
LIQUID SOAP.
我们需要的是
液体肥皂。

18:37.817 --> 18:40.553
IT'S TIME TO FIGHT BUBBLE
WITH BUBBLE.
是时候对抗泡沫了
与泡沫。

18:40.553 --> 18:42.189
- PBBBT! BUBBLES!
- 呸呸呸！气泡！

18:42.189 --> 18:44.657
THAT'S YOUR ANSWER
FOR EVERYTHING.
这就是你的答案
对于一切。

18:44.657 --> 18:47.260
- THANK YOU.
COME AGAIN.
- 谢谢。
再来吧。

18:47.260 --> 18:51.564
HEY, WHO TURNED OUT
THE LIGHTS?
嘿，结果是谁
灯光？

18:51.564 --> 18:54.201
- HELLO DOWN THERE, KRABS.
- 你好，蟹蟹。

18:54.201 --> 18:57.204
LOOK, I BROUGHT YOU
A PRETTY BALLOON.
看，我带你来了
一个漂亮的气球。

18:57.204 --> 18:59.372
AND IN RETURN,
YOU CAN GIVE ME
作为回报，
你可以给我

18:59.372 --> 19:01.674
THE KRABBY PATTY
SECRET FORMULA.
蟹肉饼
秘密配方。

19:01.674 --> 19:04.211
- WHY IN THE WORLD
WOULD I WANT TO DO THAT?
- 为什么在世界上
我想这么做吗？

19:04.211 --> 19:05.745
- 'CAUSE IF YOU DON'T,
- 因为如果你不这样做，

19:05.745 --> 19:07.680
I'M GONNA POP
THIS DISGUSTING THING
我要流行了
这件恶心的事

19:07.680 --> 19:09.749
AND DESTROY BIKINI BOTTOM!
并摧毁比基尼泳裤！

19:09.749 --> 19:12.519
AS YOU CAN SEE,
I'VE PROJECTED THE BLAST RADIUS
如您所见，
我已经预测了爆炸半径

19:12.519 --> 19:14.221
OF THIS GOOBOMBIC BALLOON,
这个古炸弹气球，

19:14.221 --> 19:17.224
AND IT'S GONNA COVER
PRETTY MUCH EVERYTHING IN TOWN.
它会覆盖
镇上几乎应有尽有。

19:17.224 --> 19:19.859
- OH, YEAH?
WELL, I CAN'T SEE NOTHIN'
- 哦，是吗？
好吧，我什么也看不见

19:19.859 --> 19:21.127
FROM DOWN HERE.
从这里开始。

19:21.127 --> 19:23.730
OH, YEAH, WELL LOOK AGAIN,
YA DINGUS!
哦，是的，再看看，
啊丁格斯！

19:23.730 --> 19:25.832
- I WON'T BE BLACKMAILED!
- 我不会被勒索！

19:25.832 --> 19:28.335
THERE'S NO WAY I'M GIVING YOU
ME SECRET FORMULER.
我没有办法给你
我的秘密配方师。

19:28.335 --> 19:30.270
- YOU HEARD HIM,
BIKINI BOTTOM.
- 你听到他的声音了，
比基尼下装。

19:30.270 --> 19:33.005
IT'S TIME TO KISS CLEAN
GOOD-BYE.
是时候亲吻干净了
再见。

19:33.005 --> 19:35.442
[sinister laughter]
- HEY, YOU!
[阴险的笑声]
- 嘿，你！

19:35.442 --> 19:36.676
YEAH, YOU.
是的，你。

19:36.676 --> 19:38.378
HOLD IT RIGHT THERE, MISTER.
握住它，先生。

19:38.378 --> 19:39.912
- EH, NOT AGAIN.
- 呃，不会了。

19:39.912 --> 19:42.849
- PREPARE TO MEET YOUR MATCH,
YOU BIG BUBBLE BULLY.
- 准备迎接你的对手，
你这个大泡泡恶霸。

19:42.849 --> 19:45.385
- WELL, THIS IS INTERESTING.
LET'S SEE WHERE IT GOES.
- 嗯，这很有趣。
让我们看看它去了哪里。

19:45.385 --> 19:48.087
- THANK NEPTUNE FOR THE BARGAIN
MART BULK DISCOUNT.
- 感谢海王星的讨价还价
市场批量折扣。

19:48.087 --> 19:49.121
- HERE GOES.
- 开始了。

19:49.121 --> 19:53.260
GERONI-BLOW!
杰罗尼吹！

19:53.260 --> 19:57.264
PRETTY SLICK, HUH?
GET HIM!
很光滑，是吧？
抓住他！

19:57.264 --> 19:59.766
- HUH? UH-OH.
- 嗯？呃-哦。

19:59.766 --> 20:01.568
- WHOO! HEH HEH.
OH, BOY!
- 呼！呵呵。
哦，男孩！

20:01.568 --> 20:03.736
GET HIM,
YOU BIG BUBBLE BRUISER.
得到他，
你这个大泡泡打击者。

20:03.736 --> 20:07.640
WHOO, HA! YOU'RE THE MAN!
YAY.
哇，哈！你就是男人！
耶。

20:14.981 --> 20:16.583
- OKAY, WHERE WERE WE?
- 好吧，我们说到哪儿了？

20:16.583 --> 20:18.885
OH, YEAH.
哦，是的。

20:22.221 --> 20:24.123
- THERE GOES A REAL HERO.
- 真正的英雄出现了。

20:24.123 --> 20:26.526
HE GAVE HIS LIFE
SO WE COULD STAY CLEAN.
他献出了自己的生命
这样我们就可以保持清洁。

20:30.663 --> 20:34.901
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

20:34.901 --> 20:37.904
[The Blue Danube plays]
[蓝色多瑙河演奏]

20:37.904 --> 20:44.444
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

20:44.444 --> 20:46.613
- OH, NO, HE'S COMING BACK!
- 哦，不，他回来了！

20:46.613 --> 20:48.348
- AND HE'S HEADING
RIGHT FOR US!
- 他正在头球
适合我们！

20:50.750 --> 20:53.420
all: AAAAHH...
全体：啊啊啊……

20:53.420 --> 20:55.355
[screech]
[尖叫]

20:55.355 --> 20:57.757
- THAT'S IT!
NO MORE MESSIN' AROUND.
- 就是这样！
别再胡闹了。

20:57.757 --> 21:01.694
GIMME THAT FORMULA, OR I'LL
DESTROY THIS STINKIN' TOWN!
给我那个公式，否则我就
摧毁这个臭小镇！

21:01.694 --> 21:04.497
- [whining]
BUT I DON'T WANNA.
- [抱怨]
但我不想。

21:04.497 --> 21:05.932
- YOU BETTER DO
WHAT HE SAYS,
- 你最好这样做
他说的话，

21:05.932 --> 21:07.567
OR WE'LL TEAR
YOUR RESTAURANT APART
否则我们会撕裂
您的餐厅与众不同

21:07.567 --> 21:09.201
AND GIVE IT TO HIM OURSELVES.
并把它交给他我们自己。

21:09.201 --> 21:10.337
- YEAH.
- 是的。

21:10.337 --> 21:13.340
- I JUST WASHED MY CAR!
- YEAH!
- 我刚刚洗了车！
- 是的！

21:13.340 --> 21:16.709
- RRRR...
OKAY, I'LL DO IT.
- RRRR...
好的，我会做的。

21:16.709 --> 21:19.346
- YEAH!
- 是的！

21:22.449 --> 21:24.417
- HERE.
I HOPE YOU CHOKE ON IT.
- 这里。
我希望你能忍住。

21:27.620 --> 21:30.156
- I CAN'T BELIEVE IT.
- 我简直不敢相信。

21:30.156 --> 21:33.626
AFTER ALL THESE YEARS,
IT'S MINE!
经过这些年，
这是我的！

21:33.626 --> 21:36.729
I'M SO HAPPY,
I COULD JUST BURST.
我很高兴，
我简直要爆炸了。

21:36.729 --> 21:38.698
THIS BUBBLE, THAT IS.
这就是泡沫。

21:38.698 --> 21:40.032
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

21:40.032 --> 21:42.669
[sinister laughter]
[阴险的笑声]

21:46.138 --> 21:48.941
- OH, THAT DIRTY LITTLE
DOUBLE-TIMER!
- 哦，那个肮脏的小东西
双定时器！

21:48.941 --> 21:52.645
- DON'T WORRY, HE'S ABOUT TO GET
WHAT'S COMING TO HIM.
- 别担心，他马上就要得到
他会发生什么。

21:55.382 --> 21:58.485
- NOW TO SEE WHAT'S INSIDE
A KRABBY PATTY.
- 现在看看里面有什么
蟹肉饼。

21:58.485 --> 22:02.188
"JUST ONE INGREDIENT:"
“只有一种成分：”

22:02.188 --> 22:04.056
DARN IT, KRABS!
该死的，蟹蟹！

22:10.963 --> 22:12.298
OW.
哦。

22:12.298 --> 22:14.133
- [laughs]
- [笑]

22:14.133 --> 22:17.036
- I DON'T SEE WHAT YOU'RE
SO GOL-DERN HAPPY ABOUT.
- 我不明白你是什么
戈尔德恩对此很高兴。

22:17.036 --> 22:18.605
THIS IS A CATASTROPHE.
这是一场灾难。

22:18.605 --> 22:20.607
- WELL, DARLIN',
IT'S LIKE THIS.
- 好吧，亲爱的，
是这样的。

22:20.607 --> 22:22.308
WHERE YOU SEE DISASTER...
当你看到灾难时...

22:22.308 --> 22:24.811
[cash register rings]
I SEE DOLLAR SIGNS.
[收银机铃声]
我看到美元符号。

22:24.811 --> 22:30.583
SO, SPONGEBOB, YOU GOT ANY
OF THE BUBBLE SOAP LEFT?
所以，海绵宝宝，你有的
还剩下泡沫肥皂吗？

22:30.583 --> 22:33.085
PLEASE HAVE YOUR MONEY READY.
请准备好您的钱。

22:33.085 --> 22:35.187
THANK YOU.
谢谢。

22:35.187 --> 22:37.990
[cash register rings]
RIGHT THIS WAY.
[收银机铃声]
就这样。

22:48.701 --> 22:51.438
- SEE, PATRICK, BUBBLES ARE
THE ANSWER TO EVERYTHING.
- 帕特里克，看，泡泡是
一切问题的答案。

22:51.438 --> 22:52.639
HA HA HA HA HA.
哈哈哈哈哈哈。

哈哈哈哈哈哈。